**Why this won’t crash:**

- Files are hashed in 64KB chunks, never fully read into memory.
- Files > 5 MB are skipped.
- Normalized hashing is only done for files < 1 MB.
- The index is cached to disk (`hash_index.json`) – subsequent runs just load it.
- Matches stream directly to disk, no giant lists.

